<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="call your name &lt;gv&gt;"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Hiroyuki Sawano"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="mpi"/><amll:meta key="album" value="「進撃の巨人」Season3 オリジナルサウンドトラック"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1468037776"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="zeloop"/></metadata></head><body dur="3:46.811"><div begin="14.229" end="3:46.811"><p begin="14.229" end="17.668" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1">She lost her brother months ago<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一个月前 她失去了她的哥哥</span></p><p begin="19.996" end="22.363" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1">His picture on the wall<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">而他的照片还挂在墙上</span></p><p begin="22.363" end="25.741" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1">And it reminds me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这让给我无法忘怀</span></p><p begin="26.817" end="32.002" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1">When she brings me coffee her smile<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">当她为我端上一杯咖啡 那笑靥如花</span></p><p begin="32.983" end="38.812" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1">I wish I could be with her &apos;til my last day<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这时我多希望能和她永远在一起 直到我生命尽头</span></p><p begin="40.372" end="44.882" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1">She said she gave all her love to me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">她说她把所有的爱都献给了我</span></p><p begin="46.362" end="48.810" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1">We dreamt a new life<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们也曾梦想过在某个和平之地</span></p><p begin="48.810" end="52.434" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1">Some place to be at peace<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">开始一段崭新的生活</span></p><p begin="53.524" end="56.524" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1">But things changed suddenly<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">然而这一切发生的太快 转瞬即逝</span></p><p begin="58.764" end="1:04.001" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1">I lost my dreams in this disaster<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">残酷的浩劫 将我的梦想毁的七零八碎</span></p><p begin="1:05.724" end="1:07.982" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1">I&apos;m crying<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我放声痛哭</span></p><p begin="1:07.982" end="1:10.542" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1">Missing my lover<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为失去了我的至爱</span></p><p begin="1:11.272" end="1:15.051" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1">I don&apos;t have the power<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我已经没有活下去的勇气了</span></p><p begin="1:15.051" end="1:18.672" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1">On my side forever<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">为何你不能永远陪伴在我身边</span></p><p begin="1:19.542" end="1:23.571" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1">Oh where is my lover?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">啊 我的爱人 你在哪里</span></p><p begin="1:23.571" end="1:28.552" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1">And I got no power<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我已无力继续了</span></p><p begin="1:29.244" end="1:36.345" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1">I&apos;m standing alone, no way<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如今一个人孤独的站着 不知该何去何从</span></p><p begin="1:36.892" end="1:42.644" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1">Calling out your name<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只能不断地呼唤你的名字</span></p><p begin="1:59.335" end="2:03.585" itunes:key="L19" ttm:agent="v1">I said I gave all my love to you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我说过我会把所有的爱给你</span></p><p begin="2:05.175" end="2:07.643" itunes:key="L20" ttm:agent="v1">We dreamt a new house<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们也梦想过在某个和平之地</span></p><p begin="2:07.643" end="2:11.675" itunes:key="L21" ttm:agent="v1">Some place to be at peace<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">拥有我们崭新的房子</span></p><p begin="2:12.624" end="2:15.931" itunes:key="L22" ttm:agent="v1">But things changed suddenly<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">然而这一切发生的太快 转瞬即逝</span></p><p begin="2:17.643" end="2:22.898" itunes:key="L23" ttm:agent="v1">I lost my dreams in this disaster<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">残酷的浩劫 将我的梦想毁的七零八碎</span></p><p begin="2:24.289" end="2:30.413" itunes:key="L24" ttm:agent="v1">We don&apos;t know what is wrong tonight<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们都不知道今晚到底出了什么差错</span></p><p begin="2:30.413" end="2:37.413" itunes:key="L25" ttm:agent="v1">Everybody&apos;s got no place to hide<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">所有人都无处可藏</span></p><p begin="2:37.850" end="2:43.831" itunes:key="L26" ttm:agent="v1">No one&apos;s left and there&apos;s no one to go on<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">到了最后 无人离开 亦无人愿意继续向前走</span></p><p begin="2:44.053" end="2:51.439" itunes:key="L27" ttm:agent="v1">All I know is my life is gone<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我所知道的只是 我的生活</span></p><p begin="3:04.223" end="3:06.211" itunes:key="L28" ttm:agent="v1">I&apos;m crying<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我放声痛哭</span></p><p begin="3:06.211" end="3:09.203" itunes:key="L29" ttm:agent="v1">Missing my lover<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为失去了我的至爱</span></p><p begin="3:09.483" end="3:13.661" itunes:key="L30" ttm:agent="v1">I don&apos;t have the power<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我已经没有活下去的勇气了</span></p><p begin="3:13.661" end="3:17.101" itunes:key="L31" ttm:agent="v1">On my side forever<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">为何你不能永远陪伴在我身边</span></p><p begin="3:17.992" end="3:22.872" itunes:key="L32" ttm:agent="v1">Oh where is my lover<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">啊 我的爱人 你身处何方</span></p><p begin="3:22.872" end="3:26.909" itunes:key="L33" ttm:agent="v1">And I got no power<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我已无力继续了</span></p><p begin="3:27.621" end="3:34.411" itunes:key="L34" ttm:agent="v1">I&apos;m standing alone no way<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如今一个人孤独的站着 不知该何去何从</span></p><p begin="3:35.189" end="3:46.811" itunes:key="L35" ttm:agent="v1">Calling out your name<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只能不断地呼唤你的名字</span></p></div></body></tt>